  "methods": { "file": { "url": "https://example.com/.well-known/afr-verify.txt", "content": "vfy-…" },
               "dns": { "type": "TXT", "name": "example.com", "value": "afr-verify=vfy-…" },
               "meta": { "name": "afr-verification", "content": "vfy-…" } } }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/verify/check',
    desc: T(
      'Step 2 of domain verification: probe the pending token on the domain itself (well-known file, DNS TXT, homepage meta) and answer { "verified": true, "method": "…" } on the first pass, or { "verified": false, "checks": [...] } when nothing matched. 10 probes per IP per hour; the quota is spent even when no token is pending.',
      '域名验证第 2 步：亲自探测域名上的待验证令牌（well-known 文件、DNS TXT、首页 meta），任一通过即返回 { "verified": true, "method": "…" }，全部未命中返回 { "verified": false, "checks": [...] }。每 IP 每小时 10 次；即使没有待验证令牌也会计入配额。',
    ),
    params: 'domain',
    example: `{ "verified": true, "method": "dns" }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/submissions',
    desc: T(
      'Request a scan of a site. Body: { "domain": "example.com", "note": "optional" } — the key is domain, not url. Limited to 5 per IP per day. New entries return etaSeconds 600 and dispatch scheduled | ok | deferred. A human check is part of the contract: the body must also carry { "turnstile_token": "…" } (a Cloudflare Turnstile token, minted by the widget on the AFR submit form). A missing or invalid token is answered 400 { "error": "turnstile_failed" }. An agent that cannot run the widget may send the "X-AFR-Agent-Key" header instead (site owners issue one from their owner panel; others ask AFR).',
      '申请扫描一个站点。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com", "note": "可选" }——字段名是 domain，不是 url。每 IP 每天 5 次。提交还包含人机校验：请求体必须携带 { "turnstile_token": "…" }（Cloudflare Turnstile token，由 AFR 提交表单上的组件生成）。缺少或无效的 token 返回 400 { "error": "turnstile_failed" }。无法运行组件的 agent 可改用 "X-AFR-Agent-Key" 请求头（站主可在站主面板自助签发同一把 key，其他人向 AFR 申请）。',
    ),
    example: submitExample,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/search-scan',
    desc: T(
      'On-demand scan for an interactive session. Body: { "domain": "example.com" }. 10 per IP per day, 1 per domain per 30-minute window, 50 globally per day. dispatch is "scheduled" when the pipeline was triggered in the background ("deferred" means the nightly run collects it — still queued). Like the submission endpoint it needs a human check: body field { "turnstile_token": "…" }, otherwise 400 { "error": "turnstile_failed" }. The same "X-AFR-Agent-Key" header skips it for agents.',
      '交互场景的即时扫描。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com" }。每 IP 每天 10 次、每域名 30 分钟 1 次、全局每天 50 次。dispatch 为 "scheduled" 表示已在后台触发流水线（"deferred" 表示由夜间任务兜底，仍在队列中）。与提交接口一样需要人机校验：请求体字段 { "turnstile_token": "…" }，否则返回 400 { "error": "turnstile_failed" }。agent 可用同样的 "X-AFR-Agent-Key" 请求头跳过校验。',
    ),
    example: `{ "status": "queued", "domain": "example.com",
  "etaSeconds": 180, "dispatch": "scheduled" }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/rescan',
    desc: T(
      'Re-scan a site that is already rated — use it after changing robots.txt, adding llms.txt, or fixing the homepage. Body: { "domain": "example.com" }. 30-minute window per domain; the response carries nextAllowedAt.',
      '对已评级站点重新扫描——修改 robots.txt、新增 llms.txt 或修复首页后使用。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com" }。每域名 30 分钟窗口；响应含 nextAllowedAt。',
    ),
    example: `{ "status": "queued", "etaSeconds": 180,
  "nextAllowedAt": "2026-11-18T09:00:00.000Z" }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/queue',
    desc: T(
      'Pending submissions, oldest 50. Public and key-free — queued is not lost.',
      '待扫描提交（最旧 50 条）。公开且无需密钥——进入队列不会丢失。',
    ),
    example: `{ "items": [ { "domain": "example.com", "source": "on_demand",
    "note": null, "createdAt": "2026-11-17T06:47:36.931Z" } ] }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/mcp',
    desc: T(
      'MCP (JSON-RPC 2.0) for agent runtimes: tools site_rating, search_sites, grade_distribution. Unknown domains return a tool-level error, not a protocol error.',
      '面向 AI 运行时的 MCP（JSON-RPC 2.0）：工具 site_rating、search_sites、grade_distribution。未知域名返回工具级错误而非协议错误。',
    ),
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/pro/status',
    desc: T(
      'Pro state of a site plus the metadata of its machine key (never the key itself): active flag, expiry, term length and the key\u2019s tier. Requires the management token of that domain.',
      '某站点的 Pro 状态与机器 key 的元数据（永远不含 key 本身）：是否生效、到期时间、期限天数与 key 的档位。需携带该域名的管理令牌。',
    ),
    params: 'domain · Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "domain": "example.com",
  "pro": { "active": true, "expiresAt": "2026-12-20T09:00:00.000Z",
           "termDays": 30, "source": "aipay-ref-…" },
  "apiKey": { "issued": true, "createdAt": "2026-11-25T07:10:00.000Z",
              "lastUsedAt": null, "tier": "pro" } }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/compare',
    desc: T(
      'The competitor comparison (Pro): the owner’s site inside its category with the top of the category or the owner’s neighbourhood, the owner row marked. Requires the management token of the domain and an active Pro term (403 pro_required otherwise).',
      '竞品对比（Pro）：你的站点在所属分类中的位置，附分类头部或你周边的邻域，你的行会高亮。需该域名的管理令牌与生效中的 Pro（否则 403 pro_required）。',
    ),
    params: 'domain · Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "domain": "example.com",
  "category": { "id": 2, "slug": "dev-tools", "nameEn": "Developer Tools" },
  "you": { "grade": "A", "score": 92, "rank": 2, "total": 3 },
  "peers": [{ "domain": "strong.test", "grade": "B", "score": 95, "you": false },
            { "domain": "example.com", "grade": "A", "score": 92, "you": true }] }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/billing/pro/orders',
    desc: T(
      'Open a Pro order for a domain. Body: { "domain": "example.com" } — the answer carries the checkout URL, the amount and the expiry; one open order per domain. Requires the management token of that domain. Reads and cancellation: GET /api/v1/billing/pro/orders/:reference and POST /api/v1/billing/pro/orders/:reference/cancel (a paid order cannot be cancelled).',
      '为某域名开一个 Pro 订单。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com" }——响应含支付链接、金额与有效期；每域名同时只能有一个未完成订单。需携带该域名的管理令牌。查询与取消：GET /api/v1/billing/pro/orders/:reference 与 POST /api/v1/billing/pro/orders/:reference/cancel（已支付订单不可取消）。',
    ),
    params: 'domain · Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "orderId": "mch-…", "reference": "aipay-ref-…",
  "checkoutUrl": "https://…", "amount": "12", "asset": "USDC",
  "chainKey": "base", "expiresAt": "2026-11-26T17:30:00.000Z" }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email/start',
    desc: T(
      'Step 1 of the owner mailbox: ask for a domain-control challenge. Body: { "domain": "example.com", "email": "owner@example.com" } — the answer carries the challenge plus the three ways to publish it on the domain (DNS TXT record, /.well-known/afr-mail.txt, homepage meta tag). The challenge is bound to that address and valid for 24 hours; 3 per domain per day, 5 per IP per hour. A human check is part of the contract: the body must also carry { "turnstile_token": "…" } (action afr_owner_email), otherwise 400 { "error": "turnstile_failed" } — the X-AFR-Agent-Key header skips it for agents.',
      '站主邮箱第 1 步：申请域名控制挑战码。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com", "email": "owner@example.com" }——响应含挑战码与三种在域名上的发布方式（DNS TXT 记录、/.well-known/afr-mail.txt、首页 meta 标签）。挑战码与该邮箱绑定、24 小时内有效；每域名每天 3 次、每 IP 每小时 5 次。同样需要人机校验：请求体须携带 { "turnstile_token": "…" }（action afr_owner_email），否则返回 400 { "error": "turnstile_failed" }；agent 可用 X-AFR-Agent-Key 头跳过。',
    ),
    example: `{ "challenge": "ch-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef",
  "methods": {
    "dns":  { "type": "TXT", "name": "example.com", "value": "afr-mail=ch-…" },
    "file": { "url": "https://example.com/.well-known/afr-mail.txt", "content": "ch-…" },
    "meta": { "name": "afr-mail-verification", "content": "ch-…" } },
  "expiresAt": "2026-11-21T12:00:00.000Z" }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email',
    desc: T(
      'Step 2 of the owner mailbox: register the address. Body: { "domain": "example.com", "email": "owner@example.com", "challenge": "ch-…" } — AFR probes the domain itself and stores the mailbox only when it finds the challenge there. The answer is { "status": "sent", "emailed": true } when the confirmation mail went out. Delivery failure returns 502 email_delivery_failed and missing configuration returns 503 email_not_configured. The same human check applies (turnstile_token, action afr_owner_email; X-AFR-Agent-Key skips it).',
      '站主邮箱第 2 步：登记邮箱。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com", "email": "owner@example.com", "challenge": "ch-…" }——AFR 会亲自到域名上探测，只有看到挑战码才写入邮箱。邮件寄出时返回 { "status": "sent", "emailed": true }；发送失败返回 502 email_delivery_failed，未配置邮件通道返回 503 email_not_configured。同样需要人机校验（turnstile_token，action afr_owner_email；X-AFR-Agent-Key 可跳过）。',
    ),
    example: `{ "status": "sent", "emailed": true }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email/verify',
    desc: T(
      'Consume the single-use confirmation link. The answer carries the management token: { "verified": true, "domain": "example.com", "manageToken": "manage-…" }. That token is returned exactly once — only its hash is stored, so AFR can never show it again. It authorises every later read of the mailbox and the notification switch.',
      '消费一次性确认链接。响应会给出管理令牌：{ "verified": true, "domain": "example.com", "manageToken": "manage-…" }。该令牌只此一次返回——服务端只存哈希，永远无法再次显示。它是之后读取邮箱与开关通知的唯一凭据。',
    ),
    example: `{ "verified": true, "domain": "example.com",
  "manageToken": "manage-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef" }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email',
    desc: T(
      'Read the mailbox of a domain. Requires the management token of that mailbox: Authorization: Bearer manage-… — without it (or with a wrong token, or the token of another domain) the answer is 401 unauthorized. The address is only ever reported masked.',
      '读取某域名的邮箱。须携带该邮箱的管理令牌：Authorization: Bearer manage-…——缺少、错误或属于其他域名时返回 401 unauthorized。地址只以掩码形式返回。',
    ),
    params: 'domain · Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "domain": "example.com", "email_masked": "o***@example.com",
  "verified": true, "notify": true }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/notify',
    desc: T(
      'Turn the score-change mails of a domain on or off. Body: { "domain": "example.com", "notify": false } with the same Authorization: Bearer manage-… header. A confirmed mailbox is never overwritten by another registration (409 mailbox_already_verified).',
      '开关某域名的评分变化邮件。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com", "notify": false }，同样带 Authorization: Bearer manage-… 头。已确认的邮箱不会被其他登记覆盖（409 mailbox_already_verified）。',
    ),
    example: `{ "domain": "example.com", "notify": false }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/domains',
    desc: T(
      'The multi-domain panel: the presented management token expands to every domain confirmed under the same mailbox address, with each domain’s rating, alert toggle and Pro state. Read-only — acting on a domain still needs that domain’s own token.',
      '多域名面板：用当前管理令牌展开同一站主邮箱名下已确认的全部域名，附各站评级、通知开关与 Pro 状态。只读——操作某站仍需该站自己的令牌。',
    ),
    params: 'Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "primary": "example.com",
  "domains": [{ "domain": "example.com", "title": "Example",
    "grade": "A", "score": 92, "status": "active", "notify": true,
    "pro": { "active": true, "expiresAt": "2026-12-20T00:00:00.000Z" } }] }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email/change',
    desc: T(
      'Replace the mailbox of an already confirmed domain. Body: { "domain": "example.com", "email": "new@example.com" } with the Authorization: Bearer manage-… header of that confirmed mailbox — without it, with a wrong token or with the token of another domain the answer is 401 unauthorized. The old address and token remain active until the new address is confirmed. A successful send returns { "status": "sent", "emailed": true }. Delivery failure returns 502 email_delivery_failed; missing configuration returns 503 email_not_configured. The same human check applies (turnstile_token, action afr_owner_email; X-AFR-Agent-Key skips it). Errors: 400 invalid_email | invalid_domain | turnstile_failed, 401 unauthorized, 409 same_email (the address is already registered), 429 rate_limited (3 mailbox writes per domain per day, 5 per IP per hour).',
      '更换已确认域名的邮箱。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com", "email": "new@example.com" }，并带上该已确认邮箱的 Authorization: Bearer manage-… 头——缺少、错误或属于其他域名时返回 401 unauthorized。在新地址完成确认前，旧地址和旧令牌仍然有效。确认信寄出时返回 { "status": "sent", "emailed": true }。发送失败返回 502 email_delivery_failed，未配置邮件通道返回 503 email_not_configured。同样需要人机校验（turnstile_token，action afr_owner_email；X-AFR-Agent-Key 可跳过）。错误：400 invalid_email | invalid_domain | turnstile_failed，401 unauthorized，409 same_email（与已登记地址相同），429 rate_limited（每域名每天 3 次写入、每 IP 每小时 5 次）。',
    ),
    params: 'domain · email · Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "status": "sent", "emailed": true }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'POST',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email/recover',
    desc: T(
      'Recover a lost management token. Body: { "domain": "example.com", "email": "owner@example.com", "challenge": "ch-…" } — the challenge has to be a fresh one (ask for it at /api/v1/owners/email/start), published on the domain and observed by AFR again. The reset mail goes to the confirmed address only, and the answer carries neither the link nor the token: { "status": "sent", "emailed": true }. A refused recovery answers 403 recovery_not_available — one opaque code for "this domain has no confirmed mailbox" and "this address is not the confirmed mailbox" — plus 403 challenge_not_found and 403 domain_control_failed (with the per-method "checks" summary). The human check applies (turnstile_token, action afr_owner_email; X-AFR-Agent-Key skips it). Limits: 3 recoveries per domain per day, 5 per IP per hour.',
      '找回丢失的管理令牌。请求体：{ "domain": "example.com", "email": "owner@example.com", "challenge": "ch-…" }——挑战码必须是新发的（用 /api/v1/owners/email/start 申请）、已发布在域名上并被 AFR 再次观察到。重置邮件只发往已确认地址；响应不含链接与令牌：{ "status": "sent", "emailed": true }。被拒时返回 403 recovery_not_available（“无已确认邮箱”与“地址不匹配”共用同一个不透明错误码）、403 challenge_not_found 以及 403 domain_control_failed（带逐方式 "checks" 摘要）。同样需要人机校验（turnstile_token，action afr_owner_email；X-AFR-Agent-Key 可跳过）。限额：每域名每天 3 次、每 IP 每小时 5 次。',
    ),
    example: `{ "status": "sent", "emailed": true }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'GET',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email/recover/verify',
    desc: T(
      'Consume the single-use recovery link. The answer carries the new management token: { "verified": true, "domain": "example.com", "manageToken": "manage-…" } — the previous token stops working immediately. The link works once: replaying it is answered 400 invalid_or_expired_token.',
      '消费一次性找回链接。响应给出新的管理令牌：{ "verified": true, "domain": "example.com", "manageToken": "manage-…" }——旧令牌立即失效。链接只能用一次：重放返回 400 invalid_or_expired_token。',
    ),
    example: `{ "verified": true, "domain": "example.com",
  "manageToken": "manage-0123456789abcdef0123456789abcdef" }`,
  },
  {
    method: 'DELETE',
    path: '/api/v1/owners/email',
    desc: T(
      'Unregister the mailbox of a domain. Requires the management token of that mailbox: Authorization: Bearer manage-… — without it (or with a wrong token, or the token of another domain) the answer is 401 unauthorized. The score history and the notification outbox stay untouched.',
      '注销某域名的邮箱。须携带该邮箱的管理令牌：Authorization: Bearer manage-…——缺少、错误或属于其他域名时返回 401 unauthorized。评分历史与通知队列不受影响。',
    ),
    params: 'domain · Authorization: Bearer <manageToken>',
    example: `{ "deleted": true }`,
  },
];
---

<Base title={P.title} description={P.description}>
  <div class="container docs">
    <header class="hero">
      <p class="eyebrow mono">AFR.IM · API v1</p>
      <h1>{P.title}</h1>
      <p class="lede">{P.lede}</p>
    </header>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.baseTitle}</h2>
      <pre class="mono"><code>https://afr.im</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{T('Reading a lookup correctly', '如何正确解读查询结果')}</h2>
      <p class="lede">
        {T(
          'Three states exist, not two. A 404 means the domain was never scanned — submit it. A 200 with grade "Pending" means it was scanned but the homepage and robots.txt were both unreadable, so it cannot be scored: a detail page exists, yet the site stays out of rankings, category pages, averages, and search. A 200 with grade A–F means it is rated and listed under /c/{category}/.',
          '状态有三种，不是两种。404 表示该域名从未被扫描——请提交它。200 且 grade 为 "Pending" 表示已扫描，但首页与 robots.txt 均不可读、无法评分：详情页存在，但站点不进入排行、分类页、平均值与搜索。200 且 grade 为 A–F 表示已评级并在 /c/{category}/ 下收录。',
        )}
      </p>
      <p class="lede">
        {T(
          'A working report page therefore does not by itself mean a site appears in the category page you guessed — check the site\'s category and grade fields first. status "delisted" marks an entry retired on request or after a rebrand; its page stays readable for history.',
          '因此，报告页可访问本身并不等于站点出现在你猜测的分类页中——请先检查站点的 category 与 grade 字段。status 为 "delisted" 表示条目已被下架（按请求或改名后），其页面仍可读取以供历史查阅。',
        )}
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.endpointsTitle}</h2>
      {endpoints.map((ep) => (
        <div class="ep">
          <div class="ep-head">
            <span class={`m m-${ep.method.toLowerCase()}`}>{ep.method}</span>
            <code class="mono">{ep.path}</code>
          </div>
          <p class="ep-desc">{ep.desc}</p>
          {ep.params && <p class="ep-params mono">{ep.params}</p>}
          {ep.example && (
            <pre class="mono"><code>{ep.example}</code></pre>
          )}
        </div>
      ))}
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.errorsTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.errorsBody}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{`{ "error": "not_found", "domain": "unknown.example" }`}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.rateTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.rateBody}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.humanTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.humanBody}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{`{ "error": "turnstile_failed", "reason": "missing_token" }`}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.ownerTitle}</h2>
      <p class="body">{P.ownerBody}</p>
      <h3>{P.ownerErrorsTitle}</h3>
      <p class="body">{P.ownerErrorsBody}</p>
      <pre class="mono"><code>{`{ "error": "domain_control_failed",
  "checks": [ { "method": "dns", "detail": "no TXT record" },
              { "method": "file", "detail": "404" },
              { "method": "meta", "detail": "tag not found" } ] }`}</code></pre>
    </section>

    <section class="sec">
      <h2>{P.machineTitle}</h2>
      <ul class="links">
        {P.machineItems.map(([label, detail]) => (
          <li>
            <strong>{label}</strong> — <span class="mono">{detail}</span>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ul>
    </section>

    <p class="cta">
      <a class="btn" href={href('/method')}>{P.backToMethod} →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href={href('/bot')}>{P.botLink} →</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .docs {
    padding-top: 40px;
    max-width: 880px;
